  "detail_text": "The Government is issuing this DRAFT Request for Proposal (RFP), Solicitation Number HT001526RE001, for Clinical Reference Laboratory Testing Services. Please note the following key information regarding this draft release: Anticipated Changes: The Government does not anticipate any major modifications to this Draft RFP or its associated attachments prior to final release. Questions: Questions will not be accepted in response to this Draft Solicitation. Instructions for submitting questions will be provided upon the release of the final solicitation. Final Solicitation: The Final Solicitation is scheduled to be issued within the next seven (7) days. Please review the attached documents for full details: RFP HT001526RE001 Attachment 1 PWS Attachment 2 Addendum to FAR 52.212-1 Attachment 3 Addendum to FAR 52.212-2 Exhibit A – Price List Exhibit C – Past Performance Summary Sheet Exhibit D – Past Performance Questionnaire Exhibit E – Subcontractor Teaming Partner Letter and Table PWS Attachment 1 -Summary of DoD sites PWS Attachment 2 – DD Form1423-1 PWS Attachment 3 – B2B Gateway Implementation PWS Attachment 4 – DHA CAC Request Process PWS Attachment 5 – Request for Common Access Card PWS Attachment 6 – Example of DHA Common Training PWS Attachment 7 - DD Form 2875 System Authorization Access Request PWS Attachment 8 – Performance Requirements Summary PWS Attachment 9 – Deliverables",
